13844901695847511, 0.01048813946545124], "index": 8, "object": "embedding"}], "model": "text-embedding-3-small", "object": "list", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 6580, "total_tokens": 6580}}, "input": {"input": [" a grand conspiracy.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m96c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:20:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Mechanism fits: line jerk → fall over stern → cold shock on immersion. No drugs needed for collapse.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"8\" title=\"Low Tide\">\n    <message id=\"m97\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:25:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We're at the Kirribilli wharf now, at low tide. The stern rail screws have fresh scuff marks on them. Just as Liam predicted.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m97a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:25:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Chalk marks have been laid. I'm photographing everything with a scale for reference. Do not touch anything.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m97b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:25:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Gloves are on. I’ll handle the ruler for the close-up shots. We need to be meticulous.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m97c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:26:16+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Texted Barber our location. He okayed photos only and said an officer may swing by to supervise.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m98\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:27:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I'm sending the pics to the group now. There’s a faint but definite groove where a line could have been seated.</body>\n      <attachment type=\"image\" file=\"DSC_20250831_122702.jpg\" exif=\"ISO200;12:27:02;macro\"/>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m98a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:27:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The groove depth is about 0.5 mm. It's consistent over a 6 cm length. This is our smoking gun.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m98b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:27:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>There’s also a tiny, almost translucent filament caught right under a screw head. I almost missed it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m99\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:28:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It matches the width of the bruise perfectly. Whoever prepped this knew the ferry and the swell like the back of their hand.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m99a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:29:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I'm collecting the filament into", "=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It matches the width of the bruise perfectly. Whoever prepped this knew the ferry and the swell like the back of their hand.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m99a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:29:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I'm collecting the filament into a sterile envelope. A chain of custody photo has been taken. We're doing this by the book.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m99b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:29:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Do not remove the screw itself. Just the loose strand of filament. We can't risk compromising the evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m99c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:30:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Officer Patel just arrived. Logged our photos, bagged the envelope, said our handling makes it a lead, not primary evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m100\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:31:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Liam would have noticed a visible rope. But monofilament is nearly invisible at night, especially with the harbour lights.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m100a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:31:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The photos clearly show how it could have been at wrist height if it was tied from below the railing. A perfect trap.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m100b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:31:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>There are no knot marks. It looks like a wrap-and-wedge technique against the screw shaft. Quick and effective.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m101\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:33:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The last piece of the puzzle: whoever had the backpack also had the line. So, who handled it last night?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m101a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:33:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Liam told Alex to leave it alone. I heard him say it myself. He was very clear about it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m101b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:34:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I have a photo of Sienna passing it on her way to get the chips. She was right there.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m102\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:34:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>You did, Alex. You were the one who pointed it out to everyone in the first place. Don't", "six\"/>\n      <body>I have a photo of Sienna passing it on her way to get the chips. She was right there.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m102\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:34:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>You did, Alex. You were the one who pointed it out to everyone in the first place. Don't forget that.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m102a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:35:13+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Pointing at something isn’t the same as tying a deadly trap. The photos will show who lingered by the rail.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m102b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:35:32+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I lingered to look at the skyline. It’s not a crime to appreciate a beautiful view. You're twisting things.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m103\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:36:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I never touched it. Liam told me to leave it alone. You bought chips and then went right past the stern bench.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m103a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:36:28+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The time stamps on my photos show Sienna at the rail from 18:50:10 to 18:50:28. Then Liam approaches.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m103b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:36:52+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>And the snap from Zoe's audio was at 18:50:34. The sequence of events is incredibly tight. There's no room for error.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m104\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:38:17+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I saw Sienna alone at the rail at 18:50:10. I just thought she was taking photos of the city.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m104a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:38:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I was. The city looked alive. That’s all it was. You're all making something out of nothing.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m104b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T12:39:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The detectives will decide what's what. We’ve documented everything we can. It's in their hands now.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"9\" title=\"The Sails Breathe\">\n    <message id=\"m105\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:02:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I found a config file", "      <body>The detectives will decide what's what. We’ve documented everything we can. It's in their hands now.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"9\" title=\"The Sails Breathe\">\n    <message id=\"m105\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:02:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I found a config file on the USB with the label “SAILS_BREATHE”. That’s not a random choice of words.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m105a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:03:00+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It references specific export folders and a White Bay unit number. It’s a treasure trove of evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m105b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:03:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The passphrase and the label both use Sienna’s exact words. That directly links her intent to all of this.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m106\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:03:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>So I like metaphors. Stop trying to twist my words into a confession of guilt. This is insane.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m106a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:03:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I didn’t write that config file. Anyone could have named a file that. It proves nothing.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m106b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:04:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>But the phrase unlocked the drive. That’s the part that really bothers me. It's too specific to be a coincidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m107\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:05:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The payments to SB Holdings are noted as “curation services.” And the White Bay unit lease is in your family trust, Sienna.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m107a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:05:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That trust predates any of this. My aunt set it up years ago. It holds the lease, that's all. It's perfectly legal.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m107b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:05:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>And the crates? Who signed the receipts for them? Was it you, Sienna? Just tell us the truth.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m108\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:06:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I routed the money. She handled the intake. Liam wanted out of the whole thing", " ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>And the crates? Who signed the receipts for them? Was it you, Sienna? Just tell us the truth.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m108\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:06:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I routed the money. She handled the intake. Liam wanted out of the whole thing. We’re both culpable. But I didn’t set any trap.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m108a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:07:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>If I could take back last night, I would. This isn’t how it was supposed to end. It all spun out of control.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m108b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:07:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It ended for Liam. That’s the only point that matters now. A good man is gone because of our choices.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m109\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:08:30+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: If I tell the whole truth, will it help Marcus at all? I need to know. He doesn't deserve to go down for this.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m109a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:08:52+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <body>DM: It will help the truth come out. That’s the only thing we can control at this point. It's the right thing to do.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m110\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:09:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <body>DM: Tell it to the group first. And then you need to tell the detectives everything. No more lies.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m110a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:10:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Don’t coach her. Just let her say it in her own words. It has to be her choice.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m110b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:11:17+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Understood. You're right. This is on her now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m111\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:12:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I set a line at the rail to make him stop and listen to me. The swell did the rest. I tried to grab him, I swear.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m111a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:12:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I didn’t see the exact moment he", " <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I set a line at the rail to make him stop and listen to me. The swell did the rest. I tried to grab him, I swear.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m111a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:12:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I didn’t see the exact moment he went over. It all happened so fast. One second he was there, the next he was gone.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m111c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:13:11+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I had a pre‑cut loop palmed from that backpack. During the group photo, I wrapped and wedged it under the screw head in a second.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m111d\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:13:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The flash, the wind—everyone looked forward. I thought it would just check him, make him listen. I was wrong.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m111b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:12:51+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That decision to set the line caused his fall. That’s what matters in the end. It was your action.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m112\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:13:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The bruise on his wrist matches your story. It was preventable. You knew the risks. You knew what could happen.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m112a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:14:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We’ll forward everything we have to the detectives now. There will be no more debate here. It's over.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m112b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:14:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’m packaging the audio files, photos, and all of our message exports. They'll have the full picture.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m113\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:15:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I was the one who disabled a bag alarm at the quay earlier. That’s the “alarm” the ferry logged. I just needed a minute.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m113a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:15:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That ties the 18:21 delay directly to you. You need to tell them that too. Every single detail matters now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m113b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:16:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I will.", "\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That ties the 18:21 delay directly to you. You need to tell them that too. Every single detail matters now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m113b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T19:16:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I will. I’m done with all the hiding. It's time to face the consequences of my actions.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"10\" title=\"Harbour Dawn\">\n    <message id=\"m114\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:01:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The detectives have the USB, all the photos, and this entire chat log. They’re on their way to you now, Sienna.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m114a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:01:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I gave them a written and signed timeline, with links to all of our media. They have everything they need.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m114b\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:01:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The checksum sheet has been printed and signed. They appreciated the thoroughness of our documentation.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m114c\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:02:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Detectives said our noon photos guided their scene work, but they’ll rely on their own collections in court.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m115\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:03:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll give my full statement. No more shells. No more lies. I'm done with that life.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m115a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:03:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>My lawyer says to cooperate fully. It’s the only viable path left for me now. I have to face the music.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m115b\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:04:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Good. Transparency is the only currency that matters at this point. The truth will set you free, in a way.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m116\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:05:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I keep hearing the alarm and the sound of the water. I think I’m going to take a break from the quay for a while.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m116a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:06:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <body>DM: How about coffee", "priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I keep hearing the alarm and the sound of the water. I think I’m going to take a break from the quay for a while.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m116a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:06:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <body>DM: How about coffee at the Rocks later? A quiet place. No view of the harbour. We could all use a break.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m116b\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:06:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Yes. Thank you, Alex. I’d like that very much. I could use a friend right now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m117\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:07:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The sails of the Opera House look so still in the dawn. No breathing. Just cold, hard light.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m117a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:07:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Some truths don’t move, even when the water does. They're constant and unyielding.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m117b\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:07:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll text you all some updates after I’ve spoken to them. You deserve to know what happens next.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m118\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:08:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll write it all straight. Liam deserves the honest truth, not some sensationalized twist. He was a good man.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m118a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:08:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>No adjectives that he can’t argue with, wherever he is now. Just the facts. He deserves that much.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m118b\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:09:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll attend the inquest if they allow public observers. I want to see justice served for Liam.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m119\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:10:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll meet them at the museum steps. I’m so sorry for everything. For all the lies and the pain I've caused.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m119a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:10:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Tell the truth, from start to finish. It’s all that matters now. It's the only way forward.</body>\n    </", " museum steps. I’m so sorry for everything. For all the lies and the pain I've caused.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m119a\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:10:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Tell the truth, from start to finish. It’s all that matters now. It's the only way forward.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m119b\" ts=\"2025-09-01T06:10:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I will. I'll do it for Liam. He deserves at least that much from me.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n</story>\n"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_98d1150ad7ca234ca9c79ff529d0d3a8b8660aa8c0adf042f3b112b34f857f9f_v2"}